# The extracted ClamAV build lives on each stick at the stick root, never
# in the repo: clamscan.exe, freshclam.exe, sigtool.exe, freshclam.conf and
# the database\ folder. The definition files alone run to a couple of
# hundred megabytes and change on every scan, so this rule is load-bearing.
# Update.cmd also skips this folder so updates cannot wipe it.
#
# Must stay at the repo root: a .gitignore only applies from its own
# directory down.
ClamAV/

# Older layout kept the same binaries under Tools\; still honoured.
Tools/

# Run logs (the cleanup script itself only logs to %TEMP%, but keep the
# stick clean if anything ever drops a log here).
*.log

# Downloaded executables and archives.
*.exe
*.dll
*.msi
*.zip
